## Context

skills/hunt/SKILL.md step 2b detaches an interactive hunt to ONE background
worktree-isolated agent "with the coder profile (agents/coder.md)" whose first
action is `Skill(skill: "hunt", ...)`. agents/coder.md line 4 declares
`tools: Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, Write, Edit` — no Skill, no Agent. On
2026-10-09 (ticket 1046) the coder executor stopped at once: it could not load
hunt, the finishing skills, nor launch the delegated reviewer, nor run
/review-pr (which spawns seats). A general-purpose relaunch with the same brief
completed (PR #1305). Every detached hunt hits this, so the default path is
broken.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] The executor hunt step 2b launches has the Skill and Agent tools (fix
      the coder tool list, or point 2b at a profile that has them)
- [ ] A test pins that the profile hunt names for detachment carries Skill and Agent
